            "description": "Show a native email draft in chat for user review. This NEVER sends. Discover the exact GMAIL_SEND_EMAIL schema first, then supply the connected account, recipients, subject and plain-text body as arguments. Requires a verified connected sender identity. HTML and unsupported providers must use a provider draft-creation action instead. The user can click Send; wait for its exact approval before executing. Do not repeat the draft as prose.",
